    <comment>2 x comp test - no results. deep tap test - failed on basal DH on Hard 3. Midpack is solid w/ no weakness. WX \nlast. Inversion for last 5 days between study plot and parker upper. Cold temps w/ clear skies for the last 2 \nweeks and only trace snow flurries in that time.  Overall snowpack has stiffened and continues to develop \nfacets.  ALP - Mod due to basal FC/DH layer could still produce a size 2.5 - 3 if initiated from a shallow \nlocation. TL  &amp;amp; BTL at low. Cold temps have created a supportive midpack over the basal DH/FC layer. Avy \nobs in last 2 weeks have been limited to isolated locations to sz 1.5 w/ exception of 1 sz 3 SL noted on N asp \nof diadem on feb 7 that could be 2 - 5 days old. \n</comment>
